-- More Minmatar COSMOS briefings (client localization)
-- +migrate Up

UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='I don''t know if you''re up for risking that ship of yours, but if you are then I got just the job for ya. This morning I was contacted by a distraught Gallente traveler. Apparently he came here with a group of colleagues from Quafe Company while on vacation. They decided to pay Barkrik a visit along their route. Yesterday they had planned to visit some ancient ruins near one of the outlying settlements within this system ... bad idea. Fortunately for my Gallente friend, he was sick that day, and so he decided to stay behind on the station while his companions went on their "sightseeing" trip. 
Well, it didn''t end too good for them. The ancient ruins are located inside a deadspace pocket frequented by the Gist. Of course, the local who suggested they visit the ruins didn''t tell them that, and I''d hazard a guess he was in league with those scoundrels as well. Anyway, to cut the story short, these tourists were massacred by sentry guns as soon as they appeared near the ruins. 
Now here''s where you come in. The Gallente who contacted me wants his colleagues'' remains to take back with him to their families when he returns home. He was asking some mercenaries to brave the ruins and retrieve the bodies, and I overheard their conversation. I offered to get the job done for a very low price. Of course, any organs left intact after their deaths will mysteriously disappear before I let the Gallente have them, but that''s a detail I left out of our conversation. Ha ha. 
You''ll find the wreckage of the craft carrying the Gallente tourists near the ancient ruins. There are a couple Angel sentry guns that will attack you on sight. I suggest ignoring them; if you retaliate it will only cause more Gist to arrive at the scene. The ships guarding the wreckage will have to be taken care of, though. But like most Gist, they will probably be too arrogant to call for backup, at least until it''s too late. 
If you feel you''re up for this task, then let me know. I''ll pay well for those corpses.' WHERE missionID=93400 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='Are you proficient codebreaker? If you are I have need for your talents. The Sisters of EVE are conducting some very secretive research here in Ani and my master sent me out here to find out what it is. I''m already engaged in breaking into the Sister''s mainframe, but it''s proving to be troublesome. My master is getting restless and wants to start see some result. So I figured I could buy myself some time by sending him some interesting tidbits from around the constellation, preferably ones that have something to do with the Sisters.
I know that the Angels are actively gathering information themselves, so perhaps they''re sitting on something of value to me and my master. I''ll pay you a bit of money if you collect some tidbits for me. The Angels operate a listening outpost in a complex over in Traun. Head over there and snoop around. If you have the skills for it, that is.' WHERE missionID=93426 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='Excellent! For your first assignment, I want you to take care of a few pesky Minmatar brigands who''ve decided to sabotage one of our reconnaissance missions to Nakugard VIII''s moons. These Minmatar belong to an unknown organization that opposes Caldari influence in Minmatar space. This attack was probably meant to scare us off.... Quite laughable. A few cutthroats won''t prevent us from building a multi-million ISK station in Ani!' WHERE missionID=93465 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='Welcome, capsuleer. You were sent by the state? Excellent. My superiors told me you had already been briefed on our situation here, so I''ll keep this short. The kidnapped SOE officer has been cloned and the clone will do our bidding, thanks to the MC-1X implant we inserted into her head. Take her to the nearby SOE station ― hopefully the missing officer´s security clearance hasn''t been revoked and she will still be allowed entry. 
Remember, this clone is essential to the success of our operation, so don''t screw this up. The SOE intranet is the most sophisticated cyberspace in existence, and this clone is going to help us crack it.' WHERE missionID=93510 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='<Character>, welcome back. The clone is doing well; she is currently working on hacking her way into the SOE intranet. It will take a few days, and there is not much we can do to help her, so I will assign other tasks to you in the meantime. 
The contested guerilla base in Tvink is full of Angel Cartel computer terrorists. They are also said to have recently developer computer hardware unmatched by none but the Jovians. I want you to go there, kill their officers, and retrieve as much of that hardware as possible. Deliver it to me and I will reward you handsomely.' WHERE missionID=93511 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='Still no word, let alone results from our undercover clone agent. Let us hope she hasn''t been caught. 
In any case, while we wait, I want you to go back to that guerilla base in Tvink. The Angel Cartel has just invaded one of SOE''s refugee camps and kidnapped hundreds of refugees. Go and retrieve some for me, and I will deliver them to SOE as a sign of good faith. Of course, they have no idea what we have in store for them.' WHERE missionID=93512 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');
UPDATE missionObjectives SET briefingText='Black bloody hells! 
We just received a message from our undercover clone. She said that her implant had been discovered and that they were coming to take her away for inspection. Instead of letting them catch her, she did what was necessary and ended her own life. 
While our operation was not successful, I am still very impressed by your performance on the missions I have assigned to you. These reports contain everything our clone officer discovered on the SOE intranet; perhaps my superiors can put it to good use. This will be the last mission I have for you ― if you complete it, I think we can arrange for an extra payment before we send you on your way.' WHERE missionID=93513 AND (briefingText IS NULL OR briefingText='');

-- +migrate Down
-- (briefings stay)
